{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 47, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler to Japan's fair shore\nA journey grand a sight to adore\nPrepare thyself for wonders untold\nA tale of beauty brave and bold.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo a City Bright**\n\nFrom whence thou art arrive at Narita's gate\nAnd seek thy lodging a place to wait\nThen forth to Shinjuku a bustling square\nWhere neon lights do fill the air.\nExplore the gardens serene and deep\nAnd let thy weary soul softly sleep.\nA ramen feast a savory delight\nTo grace thy table through the night.\n\n**Day Two: Culture's Embrace in Tokyo's Heart**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple a sight to behold\nSenso-ji's grandeur a story told.\nThen wander through Ueno's park so green\nWhere museums stand a vibrant scene.\nObserve the Sumida River's flow\nAnd watch the city's vibrant glow.\nA traditional tea ceremony's grace\nA moment's peace in this bustling place.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Beauty a Mountain's Kiss**\n\nA journey forth to Hakone's land\nWhere Mount Fuji's peak doth stand.\nCruise Lake Ashi a vista grand\nWith views of nature close at hand.\nRide the ropeway a thrilling flight\nAnd bathe in onsen pure and bright.\nArt galleries and crafts to view\nA tranquil escape for me and you.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Charm a Historical Scene**\n\nNow journey hence to Kyoto's keep\nWhere ancient temples softly sleep.\nKinkaku-ji's gold a dazzling gleam\nA vision painted like a dream.\nFushimi Inari's gates so red\nA path of wishes softly tread.\nGion district a geisha's grace\nA timeless beauty in this place.\n\n**Day Five: Nara's Deer a Gentle Pace**\n\nTo Nara we go with hearts alight\nTo see the deer a wondrous sight.\nTodai-ji's Buddha a giant form\nProtected from the brewing storm.\nExplore Kasuga Taisha's shrine\nWith lanterns glowing a divine\nAnd peaceful atmosphere so sweet\nA gentle respite for weary feet.\n\n**Day Six: Osaka's Delights a Culinary Quest**\n\nTo Osaka's city we now proceed\nWhere culinary treasures we shall heed.\nDotonbori's lights a vibrant show\nTakoyaki's taste a joyful flow.\nOsaka Castle proud and tall\nA testament to empires all.\nExplore Shinsekai a retro scene\nA nostalgic glimpse of what has been.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure a Farewell Sweet**\n\nThy journey nears its destined end\nA memory made a faithful friend.\nFrom Kansai Airport farewell we say\nUntil we meet on some other day.\nRemember well the sights you've seen\nThe beauty found serene and keen\nAnd carry with thee Japan's art\nForever etched within thy heart.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0029929152224212885}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3351351299206726e-05}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -0.516659677028656}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.009209651499986649}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.16942277550697327}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -1.239928126335144}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -0.026652328670024872}, {"token": "s", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "▁fair", "logprob": -0.446117103099823}, {"token": "▁shore", "logprob": -0.2475915253162384}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.06199752911925316}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.006346073932945728}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.024565231055021286}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.037648171186447144}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.22246946394443512}, {"token": "▁sight", "logprob": -0.4904215335845947}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.00047291061491705477}, {"token": "▁adore", "logprob": -0.19325146079063416}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.10551837086677551}, {"token": "Prepare", "logprob": -0.9255059957504272}, {"token": "▁thys", "logprob": -0.22713404893875122}, {"token": "elf", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.0018725732807070017}, {"token": "▁wonders", "logprob": -0.034188639372587204}, {"token": "▁untold", "logprob": -0.011657333001494408}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.0012499623699113727}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0